# Routes review requests to the MeadowBot reviewer.
#
# MeadowBot is a GitHub App, and apps cannot be requested as reviewers directly,
# so each managed repository assigns the `meadowbot` team here. Opening a PR then
# auto-requests that team, which is what triggers the bot's review.
#
# This repository needed it more than most: main requires one approving review and
# no reviewer was available, so PRs sat for eight months with green CI - including
# one whose author could not approve their own work. See MeadowBot#44.
* @MeadowlarkEngineering/meadowbot
